<v Ira Glass>Excerpts from Michael Bernard Loggins' two xeroxed zines, Fears of Your Life, Parts 1 and 2 read for us by actor Tom Wright. To get your own copy of these amazing books or to find out more about the arts program where they were made, you can visit the website of Creativity Explored. That's creativityexplored.org.

00:29:00.690 --> 00:29:23.730
