00:55:42.020 --> 00:55:59.480
<v Ira Glass>Special thanks today to Sahil Mehrotra, Dr. Daniel A. Smith, Casey Morell, and Steve Schale. Our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can listen to our archive of over 700 episodes for absolutely free. Also, there's videos and all kinds of other stuff there. thisamericanlife.org.

00:55:59.480 --> 00:56:20.390
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. His new enemy? February. He'll tell you himself, very shifty month. It's supposed to be 28 days long. You never know it's going to stick around an extra day and refuse the peaceful transfer of power into March.

00:56:20.390 --> 00:56:26.630
<v Kate>We all remember. We all remember what happened in 2016. We remember all of it, and so nobody trusts it anymore.

00:56:26.630 --> 00:56:30.680
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:56:30.680 --> 00:56:35.680
